{% comment %}
  Add to Cart: solid black with white text on hover, on every product page.

  The theme already sweeps a dark panel across the button with a rotated
  ::before, which mostly reads as black-on-hover — but it is an animation, so
  what a shopper actually sees during the sweep depends on where the wipe has
  reached. This states the end result outright so the button is unambiguously
  black with white text whenever it is hovered or focused, on set and non-set
  products alike.

  The ::before is left alone rather than disabled: it still provides the motion,
  this just guarantees where the motion lands.
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  form[action*="/cart/add"] [type="submit"]:hover,
  form[action*="/cart/add"] [type="submit"]:focus-visible,
  form[action*="/cart/add"] [name="add"]:hover,
  form[action*="/cart/add"] [name="add"]:focus-visible {
    background-color: #151515 !important;
    border-color: #151515 !important;
    color: #fff !important;
  }
  form[action*="/cart/add"] [type="submit"]:hover span,
  form[action*="/cart/add"] [type="submit"]:focus-visible span,
  form[action*="/cart/add"] [name="add"]:hover span,
  form[action*="/cart/add"] [name="add"]:focus-visible span {
    color: #fff !important;
  }
</style>
